="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="93a3f695-4d34-497a-9718-27c42fd90233" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R1jbr2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1n3p8du"><div data-rid="ddcdf5e9-6e50-4158-9548-c884e6394e13" class="r-1bdmodz alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>6. How is this different from Haritaki powder?</p></span></div><div data-rid="7be34482-4c54-4e77-bfdc-2af1fbad55ea" class="r-47frh0" aria-hidden="true"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:auto;max-height:100%" class="r-19zsjoc" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4"></path></svg></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R1jbr2:"><div data-rid="0c63ad75-b0d1-40c0-b702-d6560bc31deb" class="r-c7278n"><div data-rid="9191349e-1f36-4ea3-b97d-0c3bd0f04e59" class="r-1nqh5ji alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Powder tastes terrible and oxidizes quickly. Capsules = consistent dose, no bitter taste, stays potent longer.</p></span></div></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="48f1b00d-8171-4b5a-86e0-0d84422145d8" class="r-18mjb43"><div data-rid="9c3957e5-04b7-41fd-b0d7-5feb0f9dabb0" class="r-16mi35q" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="e0887dc1-4a0f-41be-b796-b86a938f6b05" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:Rdbr2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1jy3rgc"><div data-rid="2acb749a-7ceb-4b4f-8096-9ca7db7783cc" class="r-n0sfgr alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>7. Can I take it if I'm sensitive to detox effects?</p></span></div><div data-rid="5b4f1339-d09c-4ba2-ad7c-6973dc9493b0" class="r-1wpqx4k" aria-hidden="true"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label