not required.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="228c1f1b-0053-43f9-9ff6-093dc8439ee4" class="r-c0blcq" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="70eb6b3c-fbc0-433e-af1c-d266bb08d5ce" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:Rtbr2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1gy0vgc"><div data-rid="f5a50007-83e6-4e5d-ab25-5e34afce1c60" class="r-3jgp8h alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>9. Will this help clear mental fog or improve focus?</p></span></div><div data-rid="5d7957b6-3c52-47d8-af20-49c4650113f6" class="r-1nqzldr" aria-hidden="true"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:auto;max-height:100%" class="r-1qpekb8" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4"></path></svg></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:Rtbr2:"><div data-rid="c4ee7f27-61fa-443d-bf39-4e01a5df1b50" class="r-19f5w6w"><div data-rid="7f9247fc-07ff-4eab-b001-7118e99183ca" class="r-rgm6ev alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>When your gut is clogged, so is your brain. Haritaki clears the pathway. Users report sharper focus and clearer thinking within weeks.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="6cfc9a02-a38f-4f63-8e97-be6bb27c9270" class="r-1kfbovn" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="060f4e3c-afbd-4c3f-8313-6c6fea3aa6ad" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R15br2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-b4cj2n"><div data-rid="5fc17fac-7fa5-473d-b9a6-1a78f82d841b" class="r-109n9va alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>10. How long until I see results?</p></span></div><div data-rid="f2857dd0-4c64-4b33-8f2a-61143e5a04a2" class="r-dgcjdt" aria-hidden="true"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:auto;max-height:100%" class="r-pd9pxz" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4"></path></svg></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R15br2:"><div data-rid="c2132040-c38d-4aed-8f0a-018bbe6c3a69" class="r-m53c2p"><div data-rid="d405ae85-7c52-49f1-bb17-5db5f7083e87" class="r-xmtb8k alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Most users report vivid dreams returning within 7 days. Mental clarity improvements often noticed within 2-3 weeks of consistent use.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="35666a5f-229c-4775-9a1a-754505391b96" class="r-1cxoep1" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="cd1148dd-9a0c-48ad-84c7-4b68aff3c658" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R1dbr2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-bk9fev"><div data-rid="5c75b35f-3c78-4ba9-8b99-1fc33339fbe9" class="r-x4r947 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>11. Where is the haritaki sourced?</p></span></div><div data-rid="41b8a785-3a0a-4b5b-92f2-41965be41728" class="r-lobqim" aria-hidden="true"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:auto;max-height:100%" class="r-z6ulex" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4"></path></svg></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R1dbr2:"><div data-rid="3a8a3eee-6b27-47ed-9c26-cbb9a0e5cbe2" class="r-6hw676"><div data-rid="66fe472f-689f-414b-aacf-5436c4137de4" class="r-d0wc1o alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>100% Himalayan-sourced, organic, cold-processed